      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a post from 2021, but I feel exactly the same way.\n\nI think that everything locally, including logs, cache, and settings, should be prepared for each profile, like the profile features in Chrome and Firefox.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
