  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-11T06:10:21.589Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So there are many times when testing stuff that i need to test things both locally and remote (aka my and another perspective)\nThis is doable with the Profile launch command already. \nBut the issue is that VRChat syncs settings across all profiles\nMeaning that if i change my audio settings on one it changes for the other.\nthis makes things difficult when your hearing everything twitch in a map\nWould be nice to have the profile selection also dictate settings \nSo having different ones per profile \nCould be done by using the profile selection in a  econd set of registry values.\nor by storing the game settings in another location.",
